ation "a sentinel, so the next read changes it.") (source "RVI-RV32I §1.1.4")) (step (n 22) (insn "sc.d.rl x12, x11, (x1)") (writes (write (reg "x12") (value "0x0000000000000000"))) (derivation "a release SC pairs with it: 0x0000000000000000.") (source "RVI-A §12.1")) (step (n 23) (insn "fence 0, 15, 15, x0, x0") (writes) (derivation "FENCE IORW, IORW: it orders against other agents, and there are none.") (source "RVI-RV32I §1.1.7")) (step (n 24) (insn "addi x13, x0, 77") (writes (write (reg "x13") (value "0x000000000000004d"))) (derivation "a sentinel, so the next read changes it.") (source "RVI-RV32I §1.1.4")) (step (n 25) (insn "ld x13, x1, 0") (writes (write (reg "x13") (value "0x0000000000000032"))) (derivation "the value is still the SC's: 0x0000000000000032.") (source "RVI-RV64I §3.1.3")) (step (n 26) (insn "fence 0, 3, 3, x0, x0") (writes) (derivation "FENCE RW, RW: it orders against other agents, and there are none.") (source "RVI-RV32I §1.1.7")) (step (n 27) (insn "addi x13, x0, 77") (writes (write (reg "x13") (value "0x000000000000004d"))) (derivation "a sentinel, so the next read changes it.") (source "RVI-RV32I §1.1.4")) (step (n 28) (insn "ld x13, x1, 0") (writes (write (reg "x13") (value "0x0000000000000032"))) (derivation "the value is still the SC's: 0x0000000000000032.") (source "RVI-RV64I §3.1.3")) (step (n 29) (insn "fence 8, 3, 3, x0, x0") (writes) (derivation "FENCE.TSO: it orders against other agents, and there are none.") (source "RVI-RV32I §1.1.7")) (step (n 30) (insn "addi x13, x0, 77") (writes (write (reg "x13") (value "0x000000000000004d"))) (derivation "a sentinel, so the next read changes it.") (source "RVI-RV32I §1.1.4")) (step (n 31) (insn "ld x13, x1, 0") (writes (write (reg "x13") (value "0x0000000000000032"))) (derivation "the value is still the SC's: 0x0000000000000032.") (source "RVI-RV64I §3.1.3")) (step (n 32) (insn "c.nop") (writes) (derivation "the end of the program.") (source "RVI-C §27.1.8")))
